      "options": {
        "content": "### NOT DEPLOYED\nNo observer exists outside the Mac mini and residential network. A host, LAN, power, or Prometheus loss can remove DNS, dashboards, rule evaluation, and notifications together. Deploy a small external DNS/dead-man witness before treating green local panels as proof of external reachability.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
